<%!--
  Focused Layout Template

  A minimal chrome layout for distraction-free experiences like POS, Terminal, and Wizards.
  This layout bypasses the normal shell navigation entirely.

  ## Usage

  LiveViews can use this layout by setting it in mount:

      def mount(_params, _session, socket) do
        {:ok, socket, layout: {McpWeb.Layouts, :focused}}
      end

  Then use the focused_layout component in render:

      def render(assigns) do
        ~H\"""
        <.focused_layout title="Point of Sale" exit={~p"/dashboard"}>
          <:left_panel>Product grid</:left_panel>
          <:right_panel>Cart summary</:right_panel>
        </.focused_layout>
        \"""
      end

  See McpWeb.Portal.FocusedLayout for available variants:
  - :two_panel - 60/40 split (default, for POS)
  - :centered - Single centered panel (for Terminal)
  - :wizard - Progress indicator with centered content
--%>
<div class="focused-layout-container min-h-screen bg-base-100">
  <.flash_group flash={@flash} />
  {@inner_content}
</div>
